example.com/proj: package "example.com/proj/missing" not found (looked in $DIR/missing)
    The import path is inside this program's module, as declared by its
    pluto.mod file, but no directory exists at the matching place. An import
    path is the module path followed by the package's directory, relative to the
    directory holding pluto.mod.
    (run "pluto explain E4006" for a longer explanation)
